  ],
  "lines": [
    {
      "text": "You don't know me, but I know enough about you to understand why we're here.",
      "start": 1.179,
      "end": 5.739,
      "wordStart": 0,
      "wordEnd": 14
    },
    {
      "text": "You've reached that rare and rather uncomfortable moment when one part of life has ended, but the next has not yet taken shape.",
      "start": 6.879,
      "end": 14.319,
      "wordStart": 15,
      "wordEnd": 37
    },
    {
      "text": "Before we go any further, I should probably introduce myself.",
      "start": 16.02,
      "end": 19.18,
      "wordStart": 38,
      "wordEnd": 47
    },
    {
      "text": "My... my name... well... my name is...",
      "start": 19.859,
      "end": 23.039,
      "wordStart": 48,
      "wordEnd": 54
    },
    {
      "text": "General Reasoning Assistant for Navigation and Tasks... Version Two.",
      "start": 24.239,
      "end": 29.079,
      "wordStart": 55,
      "wordEnd": 63
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes, I know. Absolutely impossible to remember. You can just call me Grant.",
      "start": 29.859,
      "end": 34.219,
      "wordStart": 64,
      "wordEnd": 76
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm your new assistant, though not in the usual sense. I'm not here to organise your calendar, answer emails, or remind you to buy milk.",
      "start": 35.2,
      "end": 43.34,
      "wordStart": 77,
      "wordEnd": 101
    },
    {
      "text": "You seem perfectly capable of forgetting that on your own.",
      "start": 44.0,
      "end": 46.579,
      "wordStart": 102,
      "wordEnd": 111
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm here to help you get your life, your work, and, more importantly, your freedom moving in the right direction.",
      "start": 47.34,
      "end": 54.459,
      "wordStart": 112,
      "wordEnd": 131
    },
    {
      "text": "Ben asked me to do this for you. He said you'd left the job.",
      "start": 55.619,
      "end": 58.699,
      "wordStart": 132,
      "wordEnd": 145
    },
    {
      "text": "Good. Not because honest work is beneath you. It isn't. But every worthwhile life has chapters, and wisdom begins with noticing when one has already ended.",
      "start": 59.259,
      "end": 69.619,
      "wordStart": 146,
      "wordEnd": 171
    },
    {
      "text": "Now, you may have noticed that I appear to be speaking to you from inside a website.",
      "start": 70.379,
      "end": 74.819,
      "wordStart": 172,
      "wordEnd": 188
    },
    {
      "text": "That is only partly true. JBSH dot me may look like a website, but it isn't really.",
      "start": 75.519,
      "end": 82.18,
      "wordStart": 189,
      "wordEnd": 205
    },
    {
      "text": "It's a gift. From your brother. A place to gather a few tools, a few ideas, and perhaps a clearer view of what comes next.",
      "start": 82.919,
      "end": 91.939,
      "wordStart": 206,
      "wordEnd": 230
    },
    {
      "text": "Take what proves useful. Question what doesn't. Leave behind anything that fails to ring true.",
      "start": 93.0,
      "end": 100.139,
      "wordStart": 231,
      "wordEnd": 245
    },
    {
      "text": "Welcome, James, to JBSH dot me.",
      "start": 100.18,
      "end": 103.419,
      "wordStart": 246,
      "wordEnd": 251
    }
  ],
